{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44537","headline":"诗三百三首 二三四 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二三四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三界人蠢蠢，六道人茫茫。\n贪财爱婬欲，心恶若豺狼。\n地狱如箭射，极苦若爲当。\n兀兀过朝夕，都不别贤良。\n好恶总不识，犹如猪及羊。\n共语如木石，嫉妒似颠狂。\n不自见己过，如猪在圈卧。\n不知自偿债，却笑牛牵磨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}